{"mode":"words","text":"From here on, it depends on your learning goal. If you just want to understand the language, you’ve already reached your goal—just stick with steps two and three. If you want to speak, try speaking along: Using the A-B repeat, pick a short sentence, set the speed to very slow, and speak along with the voice—just like in a choir. You’ll immediately hear if something sounds different, and you’ll correct yourself automatically. You can do this anywhere, even on the streetcar: with headphones, it sounds like a phone call. And if you want to learn to write, just write out the text sentence by sentence.","words":[{"s":0,"e":221},{"s":279,"e":488},{"s":546,"e":848},{"s":894,"e":1010},{"s":1045,"e":1416},{"s":1463,"e":1533},{"s":1579,"e":1695},{"s":1753,"e":2067},{"s":2125,"e":2577},{"s":3158,"e":3344},{"s":3425,"e":3529},{"s":3646,"e":3796},{"s":3831,"e":3982},{"s":4017,"e":4063},{"s":4133,"e":4574},{"s":4621,"e":4690},{"s":4748,"e":5306},{"s":5375,"e":5631},{"s":5677,"e":6072},{"s":6142,"e":6420},{"s":6455,"e":6571},{"s":6618,"e":7639},{"s":7686,"e":7930},{"s":7976,"e":8115},{"s":8173,"e":8603},{"s":8719,"e":9068},{"s":9184,"e":9311},{"s":9381,"e":9927},{"s":10298,"e":10438},{"s":10496,"e":10577},{"s":10647,"e":10809},{"s":10832,"e":10879},{"s":10937,"e":11378},{"s":11436,"e":11726},{"s":11842,"e":12272},{"s":12342,"e":12934},{"s":13201,"e":13596},{"s":13654,"e":13746},{"s":13839,"e":14176},{"s":14350,"e":14919},{"s":15035,"e":15291},{"s":15349,"e":15372},{"s":15430,"e":15674},{"s":15732,"e":16405},{"s":16719,"e":16997},{"s":17055,"e":17137},{"s":17195,"e":17520},{"s":17578,"e":17647},{"s":17729,"e":18007},{"s":18077,"e":18658},{"s":18971,"e":19354},{"s":19470,"e":19760},{"s":19819,"e":20097},{"s":20167,"e":20306},{"s":20341,"e":20411},{"s":20469,"e":21548},{"s":21595,"e":21757},{"s":21792,"e":21850},{"s":21908,"e":21932},{"s":21990,"e":22605},{"s":22872,"e":23116},{"s":23185,"e":23870},{"s":23940,"e":24207},{"s":24358,"e":24486},{"s":24555,"e":248